# Siren's Call's "before attackers are declared" is the turn's first combat phase's (CR 506.8d). World at War adds a combat
# phase after the second main phase. Bot2 casts Siren's Call in the first combat's beginning of combat step, then Merciful
# Mandate ends that combat before any attackers are declared (CR 724.2d). The first combat is over all the same, so in the
# added combat's beginning of combat step the second Siren's Call is refused.
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
World at War
Merciful Mandate
Plains x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Siren's Call
Siren's Call
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.World at War.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.BeginCombat]
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Siren's Call.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Merciful Mandate.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Accept
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
[T3 Bot1.BeginCombat]
! Bot2.Hand.Siren's Call.Cast
[Expect]
Step = BeginCombat
Bot2.Graveyard = Siren's Call
